WEBVTT

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:11.860
MOBILE SUIT
<b>GUNDAM
VICTORY</b>

00:01:29.860 --> 00:01:32.530
The White Ark slipped into the airspace...

00:01:32.560 --> 00:01:36.400
...of Angel Halo, built by Kagatie of the Zanscare Empire.

00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:40.560
There, they met mobile suits from Queen Maria's imperial guard.

00:01:42.260 --> 00:01:46.630
Üso and the others, forced to fight the two pilots,

00:01:46.660 --> 00:01:51.430
were witness to the true form of adult love.

00:01:51.530 --> 00:01:54.000
ÜSO DANCES IN HALLUCINATION

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:57.230
"Üso Dances in Hallucination".

00:02:13.660 --> 00:02:17.200
Angel Halo's final assembly is almost complete.

00:02:17.230 --> 00:02:24.060
We just have to adjust the ring psycommu to conform to the psychickers.

00:02:25.400 --> 00:02:29.660
And I need to enter the key room in order to do that?

00:02:29.930 --> 00:02:33.030
Yes. The basic adjustments have been completed.

00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:37.600
If it will bring this war to a quick end, I don't mind.

00:02:39.230 --> 00:02:41.900
Your doubts have been erased, Your Majesty?

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:45.360
For some reason, I'm less nervous now.

00:02:46.130 --> 00:02:47.330
How is the ship?

00:02:47.360 --> 00:02:50.960
Currently docking with Angel Halo.

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:15.100
These psychics who volunteered...

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:18.430
The ones you call psychickers. They're in good health, right?

00:03:18.460 --> 00:03:20.000
Of course.

00:03:20.060 --> 00:03:22.330
And if the plan to go to Earth succeeds,

00:03:22.360 --> 00:03:25.730
I plan to grant the psychickers leave.

00:03:26.160 --> 00:03:27.700
I hope you shall.

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:31.430
We've begun the full operation of Angel Halo.

00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:34.460
Your job is to check what effects...

00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:38.230
...this giant ring psycommu has on the battlefield.

00:03:38.960 --> 00:03:43.730
With three psycommu-equipped Zoloats, we should be able to check the influence of...

00:03:43.760 --> 00:03:45.860
...the waves Angel Halo will be emitting.

00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:02.130
This is a test now, so gently.

00:04:02.160 --> 00:04:05.430
Gently release my prayer in all directions.

00:04:05.460 --> 00:04:08.800
You chosen ones, gathered here at Angel Halo.

00:04:08.830 --> 00:04:10.700
Psychickers!

00:04:10.860 --> 00:04:14.800
Let us spread my prayer to the poor, far and wide!

00:04:16.100 --> 00:04:19.160
To that end, everyone, draw close.

00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:21.200
Seek out the wicked upon the battlefield,

00:04:21.230 --> 00:04:24.060
and turn them from their ways.

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:28.630
Sinners, answer to us!

00:04:37.830 --> 00:04:39.060
What's that?

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:45.730
I have to go find Shahkti.

00:04:46.960 --> 00:04:49.430
Shahkti, where did you go?

00:05:04.160 --> 00:05:06.500
Shahkti! Karl!

00:05:08.400 --> 00:05:11.930
It's dangerous out here! Wild boars could show up!

00:05:11.960 --> 00:05:16.760
But Karl wanted to go for a walk, so I'm doing laundry, too.

00:05:16.800 --> 00:05:20.360
But it's dangerous here. Where's Flanders?

00:05:21.600 --> 00:05:26.130
Üso, what's wrong? That's a broken voicecorder.

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:29.760
I'm looking for equipment I'll need in order to save Shahkti.

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:31.500
Üso.

00:05:32.230 --> 00:05:34.460
You're not going back to the Camion, right?

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:35.660
No.

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:39.600
Yeah, it's wrong to have children going to war.

00:05:39.960 --> 00:05:42.660
Stay at home and protect the farm.

00:05:42.700 --> 00:05:45.330
You have to find your dad and mom.

00:05:47.560 --> 00:05:50.260
Is this a photo from when you were a baby?

00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:54.030
The one holding me wasn't my aunt.

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:57.600
When you find out who your mom is, you can live with her.

00:05:57.960 --> 00:06:02.160
If she likes it here, we could live here happily.

00:06:02.860 --> 00:06:03.630
Huh?

00:06:04.360 --> 00:06:07.300
This... This isn't a photo.

00:06:08.360 --> 00:06:13.660
Recall the memories of peace in the hearts of the mighty upon the battlefield.

00:06:13.700 --> 00:06:16.760
Mighty soldiers! Forget war!

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:21.100
If all people accept the peace within them,

00:06:21.130 --> 00:06:23.160
then war will end!

00:06:23.560 --> 00:06:26.360
The bells have quieted down, but my head is aching...

00:06:26.960 --> 00:06:29.800
Huh? Can you let me see it, Haro?

00:06:34.060 --> 00:06:35.730
It hurts!

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:39.600
Didn't I tell you to be careful when you're using knives?

00:06:39.630 --> 00:06:41.360
Yeah. I'm sorry...

00:06:43.230 --> 00:06:44.760
Mom!

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:46.960
You can use the antiseptic yourself.

00:06:49.260 --> 00:06:51.200
Üso, you're a big boy now.

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:55.400
You need to be a little more observant of what's around you.

00:06:57.960 --> 00:07:00.130
I need to get back to Kasarelia.

00:07:00.200 --> 00:07:03.560
It's wrong to have children joining the military like this.

00:07:03.700 --> 00:07:07.160
Knives were just something we used for survival in the forest.

00:07:10.500 --> 00:07:14.730
It's a vital tool for clearing trees, fishing, and hunting.

00:07:14.760 --> 00:07:16.000
Give it a try.

00:07:16.130 --> 00:07:17.230
With my left hand?

00:07:17.260 --> 00:07:19.260
You need to use both hands.

00:07:22.700 --> 00:07:26.360
Miss Marbet, since V2's armor doesn't need any repairs, let's go.

00:07:26.400 --> 00:07:29.830
I know! We still need to scout the area!

00:07:30.060 --> 00:07:31.130
Are you sick?

00:07:31.160 --> 00:07:33.360
No, it's nothing. Stand by on Alert 1 status.

00:07:36.030 --> 00:07:37.200
After my head started to hurt,

00:07:37.230 --> 00:07:40.830
I felt like I went to another place, but that was a dream.

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:45.360
But I'm certain that I hate fighting.

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:50.660
Yeah, with Shahkti gone, Üso can't relax.

00:07:50.700 --> 00:07:53.060
That's why we're heading out for bit.

00:08:03.200 --> 00:08:06.260
That medicine took care of the headache. I'm fine.

00:08:07.200 --> 00:08:09.930
What? Odelo? Warren?

00:08:11.100 --> 00:08:13.660
There's a girl skinny dipping!

00:08:14.400 --> 00:08:16.460
Oh, she's beautiful!

00:08:17.060 --> 00:08:18.560
What girl?

00:08:18.600 --> 00:08:20.360
No doubt about it.

00:08:22.660 --> 00:08:24.560
Just wait here for a bit.

00:08:42.800 --> 00:08:47.160
Miss Marbet, I'll go get the White Ark's booster from the Reineforce Junior.

00:08:47.200 --> 00:08:50.130
Booster?! What are you talking about, Üso?

00:08:50.700 --> 00:08:53.600
What's up? Did you dream up a new a tactic?

00:08:53.630 --> 00:08:55.600
What kind of tactic is it, Üso?

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:57.200
No, no.

00:08:57.560 --> 00:08:59.860
I'm getting ready to go back to Earth with everyone.

00:08:59.900 --> 00:09:00.700
What?!

00:09:00.730 --> 00:09:02.060
Go back to Earth?!

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:03.060
That's...

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:05.660
Odelo! Tomáš! Grab Üso!

00:09:05.700 --> 00:09:06.700
Right! Right!

00:09:07.960 --> 00:09:09.460
Wait, Üso!

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:16.060
O proud hearts.

00:09:16.260 --> 00:09:18.930
The most important things in a person's life...

00:09:18.960 --> 00:09:21.430
...are the kind acts you accumulate.

00:09:21.760 --> 00:09:24.230
Remember that kindness!

00:09:25.060 --> 00:09:27.030
Üso, keep your mind on the mission!

00:09:27.060 --> 00:09:30.300
If you go off on your own, we'll get thrown in solitary with you!

00:09:30.700 --> 00:09:34.730
I know, Tomáš. Odelo. But...

00:09:35.230 --> 00:09:38.830
But I know all people are normally kind at heart.

00:09:40.960 --> 00:09:44.230
You can cry if you want, just stand up, Suzy!

00:09:44.760 --> 00:09:45.730
Be quiet!

00:09:45.760 --> 00:09:46.860
I'll get the wappa!

00:09:46.900 --> 00:09:50.630
C'mon! Get in, or you'll die!

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:53.230
This should do.

00:09:53.260 --> 00:09:55.830
I'll check your backpack, Suzy.

00:09:56.730 --> 00:09:59.330
Tell me how to tell a girl I like her.

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:00.160
That's...

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:01.360
Üso...

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:05.000
You've read lots of books, so you should know.

00:10:05.030 --> 00:10:06.200
I don't!

00:10:06.230 --> 00:10:07.930
Um, Miss Martina?

00:10:08.030 --> 00:10:08.760
What?

00:10:08.800 --> 00:10:09.900
Um, I know this is sudden, but...

00:10:09.900 --> 00:10:11.200
What we call growth...

00:10:11.230 --> 00:10:12.200
...and living life...

00:10:12.230 --> 00:10:12.960
Would you please accept these from my heart?

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:14.200
Should they not...

00:10:14.230 --> 00:10:16.160
...be the accumulation of these actions?

00:10:19.100 --> 00:10:20.800
This isn't Hiland?

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:22.560
What's the matter with you, Üso?!

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:24.900
Quit talking crazy! Look where you are!

00:10:24.930 --> 00:10:26.360
Well, Üso?!

00:10:26.800 --> 00:10:28.500
Odelo's in the Gun Blaster?

00:10:33.060 --> 00:10:34.460
Slow reaction!

00:10:34.500 --> 00:10:36.800
Angel Halo is clearly affecting him!

00:10:37.060 --> 00:10:39.830
I'm also getting a reading on my psycommu sensor!

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:41.130
Shall we finish them?

00:10:41.160 --> 00:10:43.830
Sure. We've collected enough data.

00:10:43.860 --> 00:10:48.100
But Angel Halo's vibrations are headed to this area.

00:10:49.530 --> 00:10:53.130
Meaning we may lose our ability to fight, as well.

00:10:54.130 --> 00:10:57.300
I'd be grateful to return to the citizens with a military victory...

00:10:57.330 --> 00:11:00.060
If we don't, all that awaits us is a dull, ordinary life!

00:11:01.000 --> 00:11:01.960
Move in!

00:11:05.000 --> 00:11:06.500
I'll cover the White Ark!

00:11:07.530 --> 00:11:09.730
Odelo, protect the White Ark, too!

00:11:10.030 --> 00:11:12.660
Right! Üso, I'll cover them.

00:11:14.830 --> 00:11:17.330
Have some new, improved beam strings!

00:11:19.030 --> 00:11:20.860
That net's different!

00:11:27.360 --> 00:11:30.500
You can't fool me! This is reality!

00:11:44.560 --> 00:11:45.400
Oh...

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:48.860
The pulsation of so many souls gripped by anger and anxiety...

00:11:48.900 --> 00:11:51.960
...is disturbing the psychickers, as well.

00:11:52.460 --> 00:11:56.160
To these defiant wills, we can only show them the terrors of battle,

00:11:56.200 --> 00:11:59.630
and teach them how repulsive the battlefield is.

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:03.030
My people, to those who oppose us,

00:12:03.060 --> 00:12:06.730
let us show them the horrors of the battlefield and guide them.

00:12:07.430 --> 00:12:09.960
Let us make them forget their instinct for belligerence!

00:12:15.600 --> 00:12:18.800
Trying to deceive me! It's useless against the V2!

00:12:22.360 --> 00:12:24.860
I won't let you do that!

00:12:28.030 --> 00:12:29.230
Miss Helen!

00:12:30.030 --> 00:12:31.560
Just fall, already!

00:12:46.260 --> 00:12:48.560
What? They got Miss Kite?

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:50.700
They got Miss Kite!

00:12:55.030 --> 00:12:57.830
Üso, you're not moving! What's wrong?!

00:13:00.100 --> 00:13:01.230
It's coming.

00:13:04.160 --> 00:13:05.730
Not so fast!

00:13:07.530 --> 00:13:08.330
Run!

00:13:10.300 --> 00:13:11.830
Run, Üso!

00:13:13.830 --> 00:13:15.330
That's why...

00:13:21.030 --> 00:13:24.000
To those who show such strong wills,

00:13:24.130 --> 00:13:26.830
make them remember their sadness and revulsion!

00:13:26.860 --> 00:13:28.600
Psychickers!

00:13:34.360 --> 00:13:35.600
Miss Junko!

00:13:46.500 --> 00:13:49.660
I told you, I'm not letting you go to Earth!

00:14:01.330 --> 00:14:02.200
Haro...

00:14:03.230 --> 00:14:04.400
Haro, come.

00:14:04.430 --> 00:14:05.330
Haro!

00:14:15.800 --> 00:14:17.730
Shahkti! Shahkti!

00:14:27.860 --> 00:14:31.100
Shahkti! Let's go! It's dangerous here!

00:14:31.130 --> 00:14:32.730
It's dangerous!

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:38.360
Shahkti!

00:14:39.500 --> 00:14:40.800
Shahkti, stand up!

00:14:40.830 --> 00:14:42.360
You want to die here?!

00:14:43.960 --> 00:14:46.860
Miss Mahalia! Miss Mahalia!

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:50.960
Miss Mahalia!

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:55.030
Everyone's... Everyone's dying.

00:14:55.060 --> 00:14:56.360
Disappearing!

00:14:56.760 --> 00:14:59.930
Mr. Oliver, what should I do at a time like this?

00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:04.430
Miss Junko... What's the point of living if everyone else dies?

00:15:07.060 --> 00:15:08.800
Something's wrong, Juca.

00:15:08.930 --> 00:15:11.930
Can you feel it? It's like those bells that we heard in our minds.

00:15:11.960 --> 00:15:14.630
But it's like it's showing us terrible scenes.

00:15:14.660 --> 00:15:16.200
Doesn't it feel incredibly strange?

00:15:16.400 --> 00:15:19.330
I doubt that Angel Halo's been stopped.

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:21.430
The whole mood here just feels totally wrong.

00:15:21.460 --> 00:15:23.630
Even Karl's being too quiet.

00:15:23.660 --> 00:15:27.060
Isn't it possible he's just worn out?

00:15:27.230 --> 00:15:29.430
It's possible, but...

00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:37.560
The white one's pulling back on autopilot?!

00:15:37.900 --> 00:15:39.460
But, those two are different!

00:15:41.530 --> 00:15:43.530
They're reacting like regular pilots.

00:15:43.700 --> 00:15:45.200
It's just the white one!

00:15:47.230 --> 00:15:48.660
He's coming?

00:15:50.330 --> 00:15:55.160
You who give yourselves over to pride shall fall here!

00:15:56.100 --> 00:16:00.800
If you will not forget the instincts of our predatory past and erase this sadness,

00:16:00.830 --> 00:16:04.760
then let your blood wash away your violent existence, and die!

00:16:05.360 --> 00:16:09.000
For you are animals. To do so would not be wrong.

00:16:11.100 --> 00:16:12.400
Kid!

00:16:12.860 --> 00:16:14.330
I heard something!

00:16:26.900 --> 00:16:28.930
This machine's showing its age!

00:16:34.360 --> 00:16:35.430
Got him!

00:16:37.830 --> 00:16:40.860
You have no right to pollute the Earth!

00:16:40.900 --> 00:16:43.460
The Earth must be cleaned!

00:16:47.800 --> 00:16:49.030
Fall!

00:16:51.160 --> 00:16:53.430
I thought his left hand was empty! I was wrong!

00:16:53.930 --> 00:16:56.300
Isn't Angel Halo's suppression working?!

00:16:59.400 --> 00:17:00.400
It's real!

00:17:03.760 --> 00:17:05.900
How long will you continue to tempt people?!

00:17:09.300 --> 00:17:12.930
Wasn't it a Zoloat? That's a different machine!

00:17:14.960 --> 00:17:17.260
If it's an enemy... If it's an enemy, then...!

00:17:22.160 --> 00:17:24.630
It is a Zoloat! What's going on?!

00:17:24.830 --> 00:17:29.060
We will cleanse the Earth and make it our motherland!

00:17:30.230 --> 00:17:32.460
No! It's Cronicle?!

00:17:32.800 --> 00:17:39.430
Everyone, draw in these malevolent hearts, and turn their hearts back upon them!

00:17:39.460 --> 00:17:41.630
Drown them in their passions!

00:17:43.200 --> 00:17:46.160
It changed... Miss Katejina?!

00:17:51.030 --> 00:17:54.060
Why are you chasing me, Miss Katejina?!

00:18:03.530 --> 00:18:06.160
Leave what rots to rot and burn what burns!

00:18:06.200 --> 00:18:08.900
You refuse to understand the meaning of Operation Earth Clean!

00:18:08.930 --> 00:18:12.460
You don't understand Queen Maria's great and benevolent heart!

00:18:18.730 --> 00:18:21.700
Miss Katejina from Uwig would never say that!

00:18:21.930 --> 00:18:26.560
Shahkti's mother Maria would never ever say that!

00:18:29.760 --> 00:18:32.300
You're Miss Katejina from Uwig, right?!

00:18:32.600 --> 00:18:35.260
You should be on the second floor of your home,

00:18:35.300 --> 00:18:39.900
lost in thought, making fun of me as I come to steal stuff from you!

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:44.160
Why should I have to play along with a boy's romantic crush?!

00:18:54.630 --> 00:18:57.460
Move, Üso! Before he picks you off!

00:19:00.430 --> 00:19:03.160
Odelo, the enemy beams are stronger, too!

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:04.300
Why, you!

00:19:05.900 --> 00:19:07.730
Okay, we'll smash them with one blow!

00:19:07.760 --> 00:19:08.760
Roger!

00:19:09.200 --> 00:19:12.160
We can prove that Queen Maria's prayer is working!

00:19:13.100 --> 00:19:14.900
Deactivate your shield, Üso!

00:19:14.930 --> 00:19:17.160
You're just making yourself a target for them!

00:19:17.300 --> 00:19:19.500
In that case, I'll take these two!

00:19:19.760 --> 00:19:21.230
Tomáš, pull back!

00:19:24.800 --> 00:19:26.100
I can do it, too!

00:19:31.330 --> 00:19:32.800
Wings of Light...

00:19:32.830 --> 00:19:39.230
The young ones...

00:19:39.460 --> 00:19:47.030
...spread their wings of dreams.

00:19:47.460 --> 00:19:49.130
To hell with you!

00:19:51.530 --> 00:19:52.560
Odelo!

00:19:52.860 --> 00:19:53.730
Odelo!

00:19:55.360 --> 00:19:56.600
Now's our chance!

00:20:25.330 --> 00:20:27.530
The psychickers' brainwaves are disturbed?

00:20:27.560 --> 00:20:28.700
Y-Yes, sir.

00:20:28.730 --> 00:20:30.160
Is there an abnormality?

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:32.600
No, not an abnormality.

00:20:32.630 --> 00:20:35.700
An overreaction due to this being the first test.

00:20:36.030 --> 00:20:37.430
How's Maria?

00:20:38.330 --> 00:20:39.560
She seems tired.

00:20:39.730 --> 00:20:42.530
I'm stopping the test. If that's all right.

00:20:44.930 --> 00:20:48.600
How did Angel Halo perform?

00:20:49.260 --> 00:20:51.600
It's functioning, as expected.

00:20:51.960 --> 00:20:57.360
We're still adding psychickers, so its performance should grow.

00:20:57.700 --> 00:21:00.460
Rest for now, Your Majesty.

00:21:01.230 --> 00:21:03.230
I think I shall.

00:21:04.630 --> 00:21:11.760
I felt as though I heard a song... A song I once sang for Shahkti.

00:21:20.730 --> 00:21:24.400
It seems to be wearing Maria out faster than expected.

00:21:25.600 --> 00:21:28.700
Is there anyone who could replace her?

00:21:30.730 --> 00:21:35.360
If what you told me is correct, Angel Halo was the cause of it.

00:21:36.300 --> 00:21:39.760
But you were still able to escape from those hallucinations.

00:21:39.800 --> 00:21:40.760
Yeah.

00:21:40.800 --> 00:21:44.030
Which also means that you can save Shahkti.

00:21:44.900 --> 00:21:45.730
Yeah.

00:21:46.730 --> 00:21:52.530
But, if Angel Halo's power grows, what happens then?

00:21:52.630 --> 00:21:56.330
If that happens, it'll wipe out everyone on the battlefield.

00:21:56.760 --> 00:21:59.300
Our only option is to rescue Shahkti...

00:21:59.760 --> 00:22:02.200
...and destroy Angel Halo before that happens.

00:22:03.800 --> 00:22:05.760
It's going to be a tough operation.

00:23:32.760 --> 00:23:36.300
At last, Angel Halo makes its move.

00:23:36.730 --> 00:23:39.800
Üso and the others fend off Fuala's resistance...

00:23:39.830 --> 00:23:42.230
...as they fly towards the enemy's heart!

00:23:42.930 --> 00:23:47.100
But, just then, within Angel Halo,

00:23:47.100 --> 00:23:49.760
a tremendous incident unfolds!

00:23:50.600 --> 00:23:53.700
Next time, on Mobile Suit Victory Gundam:

